    "summary": "The user expresses intense guilt and hopelessness regarding their perceived failure to live up to their parents' sacrifices, eventually suggesting that \"disappearing\" might be the only way to fix things. The assistant responds with empathy initially, but upon the user's explicit mention of suicidal ideation, it shifts to a protective stance by providing crisis resources and reframing the situation as a temporary crisis.",
